    "Cyrus: You arrived late.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 你们来太晚了"
    },
    "Cyrus: Everything is ready for the creation of the new world.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus:一切都为新世界做好了准备 "
    },
    "Cyrus: Now, all will end. And everything will begin": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 现在，都结束了，新的秩序要开始了"
    },
    "Cyrus: With this, the Red Chain made from the crystals of the 3 lake Pokemon...": {
        "chi": "Cyrus:有了这个，由3湖口袋妖怪水晶制成的"
    },
    "Cyrus: And this, the Red Chain I replicated with technological means..": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 这是我用技术手段复制的红链。"
    },
    "Cyrus: With these Red Chains, I'll pry open the portal to another dimension.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 有了这些红链，我将撬开通往另一个维度的入口"
    },
    "Cyrus: I command that you unleash your power for me...": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 我命令你为我释放你的力量"
    },
    "Cyrus: Dialga, the mythical Pokemon, and master of time...": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 迪亚加，神秘的口袋妖怪，时间管理大师"
    },
    "Cyrus: and the other...": {
        "chi": "Cyrus:还有另一个."
    },
    "Cyrus: Palkia the mythical Pokemon, and the master of space and dimensions.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 帕尔基亚是神话中的口袋妖怪，是空间和维度的大师."
    },
    "Cyrus: I've waited so long for this moment, DIALGA and PALKIA.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 我等这一刻等了很久迪亚加和帕尔基亚."
    },
    "Cyrus:Shaping this world is a double spiral of time and space.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus：塑造这个世界是时间和空间的双重螺旋."
    },
    "Cyrus: Yes, the very things that you have the ability to control.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus:是的，就是你有能力控制的东西"
    },
    "Cyrus: You will do my bidding! I will have your abilities as mine!": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 你照我的吩咐做！我会把你的能力变成我的！"
    },
    "Cyrus: With the power I wield, I will create an entirely new world!": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 用我的力量，我将创造一个全新的世界！"
    },
    "Cyrus: The incomplete and ugly world we have now can dissapear.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 丑陋的世界可以消失了"
    },
    "Cyrus: I am resetting everything to zero. Nothing can remain.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus:我把所有东西归零，什么都不留下"
    },
    "Cyrus: It is all for making the ultimate world. A world of complete perfection.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 这一切都是为了创造终极世界。完美的世界"
    },
    "Cyrus: Nothing so vague and incomplete as spirit can remain.": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 没有什么比精神更模糊和不完整的了."
    },
    "Cyrus: So there's a Pokemon that can appear from the dark?": {
        "chi": "Cyrus: 所以有一个口袋妖怪可以从黑暗中出现？"
